      "type": "Dataset",
      "title": "NREL Annual Technology Baseline",
      "summary": "Cost and performance projections for electricity generation and storage technologies, to 2050, in three scenarios.",
      "description": "The canonical US technology cost stack: capital cost, fixed and variable O&M, capacity factor and financing assumptions by technology and year, under conservative, moderate and advanced trajectories. Cataloged as one dataset with two domain facets rather than as two records \u2014 the storage tables and the generation tables are the same publication and splitting them would double every future update.",
